WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.160
Have you ever wondered what Agent&nbsp;
Miller wants more than anything?

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:08.800
Foundation staff snapped a picture of Agent&nbsp;
Miller, using SCP-978, The Desire Camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.880
while he was preparing equipment for a&nbsp;
collection mission. This was the result:

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:17.080
"Engaged in a firefight with&nbsp;
soldiers wearing Nazi insignias."

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:20.680
Agent Miller commented, “I watch&nbsp;
too many war films, don't I?”

